  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760013,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Killzone: Mercenary - A Synopsis\n\nStep into the boots of Arran Danner, a ruthless mercenary caught in the brutal interstellar war between the ISA and the Helghast in *Killzone: Mercenary*. Bridging the gap between *Killzone 2* and *Killzone 3*, this action-packed title delivers a fresh perspective on the conflict, letting you fight alongside both ISA and Helghast forces.\n\nThe single-player campaign unfolds with a gripping narrative, starting with a daring rescue mission and culminating in a desperate race to prevent a catastrophic viral weapon from being unleashed.  Alongside your partner, you’ll navigate treacherous environments, uncover shocking betrayals, and ultimately confront a conspiracy that threatens both planets.\n\n*Mercenary* boasts a dynamic gameplay experience, offering a vast weapon loadout and tactical customization options.  Utilize the PS Vita's unique touchscreen and rear touch panel for intuitive controls and strategic advantages.  Experience intense firefights, explosive set pieces, and a compelling story that expands the *Killzone* universe.  Will you become the ultimate mercenary and earn your place among the best?"
    },
